Package: querencia-files
Architecture: all
Depends: querencia-dateien (>= 0.2.0)
Description: Querencia Files, replaced by Querencia Dateien (transitional package)
 Querencia Files was the file manager of Querencia Desktop up to Alpha 2.2.
 It is replaced by Querencia Dateien (package querencia-dateien) and is no
 longer shipped. This transitional package removes the old program on
 upgrade.
 .
 It keeps the two starters of Files (org.querencia.Files and the older
 io.github.lgse.Strata), hidden from the menus, which start Querencia
 Dateien, so panel launchers, desktop icons and a mimeapps.list that still
 name them keep working.
 .
 It can be removed safely once no launcher refers to Querencia Files
 any more.
